WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.408
Plan your week. See your study time count.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.681
Give each subject a goal. Put the hours on your calendar.

3
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:16.160
Choose a subject and start. Pause when you need to, then return
to the same session.

4
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.624
Keep the time, rate your focus, and note what you worked on.

5
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.541
Save once. Your session appears in the log, and your goal
progress updates.

6
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:35.965
Find the session later, or step back and see where your study
time went.

7
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.985
Plan. Focus. Follow through. With Study Flow.
